#env
# -R : Output raw ANSI color escape sequences (enables terminal colors)
# -S : Chop long lines rather than wrapping them (disables word wrap)
# -F : Automatically exit if the entire file fits on one screen
# -X : Prevent clearing the terminal screen upon exit (keep output visible)
# -i : Case-insensitive search unless an uppercase character is typed
LESS = -R -S -X -i

#command
h left-scroll
l right-scroll
j forw-scroll
k back-scroll
